Added `plone_client.operations`, tasks that send several requests in the right order: create an item with files and images inside it and set its lead image, create a page from Markdown or HTML, upload a local folder keeping its structure, and copy or move items with a report. Each operation honors `dry_run` and `read_only`, returns every request it sent, and raises `PloneOperationError` with what was already created when it stops part way. The commands `create-page`, `create-with-files`, and `upload-tree` run them from the command line. @ericof
